{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "376ed3b2-118a-8083-90a7-51e931f2d362",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T12:28:41-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilza Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:26:01-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:26:04-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin? My name is Nilza Varela? I'm calling about a pothole? On my street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:26:10-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, happy to take that down. Where's the pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:26:14-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at the intersection by my house? I'm at 110 Marsh Street, in the Point? And it's right at the corner there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:26:23-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 110 Marsh Street, the Point. Got it. Can you tell me how big it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:26:30-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's about two feet across? Maybe a little more than that, I'd say two feet? [pause] Sorry, I'm on speakerphone, I'm in the kitchen, can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:26:41-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine. Two feet across, writing that down. Is it a new one, or has it been there a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:26:50-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's been patched three times? Like, somebody comes out and fills it, and then a few weeks later it opens right back up? So it's the same hole, three patches now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:27:02-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that happens, especially with the freeze and thaw and all the rain we had. Was it the rain that ended Saturday that made it worse?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:27:12-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes? After the rain on Saturday it was worse? The patch just kind of washed out? And now cars are swerving around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:27:21-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so patched three times, reopened, about two feet, cars going around it. What would you like us to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:27:29-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can you add the street to the repair list? Like, for a real repair, not just another patch? If that's something you do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:27:38-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can put in the request and note that it's a repeat location, and that it needs more than a quick fill. I can't tell you exactly when the crew will get to it, but it goes on the list with the history attached."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:27:54-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine? That's all I'm asking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:27:57-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Do you want me to use the number we have, or is there a better one for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:28:05-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can use 401-555-0160? That's my cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:28:08-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-six-zero, got it. And it's Varela, V-A-R-E-L-A?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:28:11-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right? Thank you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:28:14-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Are you from the neighborhood originally, or...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:28:18-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, we moved here from Connecticut about a year ago? And I like it? I really like it here? It's just this one hole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:28:27-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, glad you like it. We'll get this one logged. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:28:32-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's everything? Thanks, Kevin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:28:35-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling, Ms. Varela. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:28:39-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too? Bye?"
    }
  ],
